{
  "source": "Prompts/layers-6.mp4",
  "duration": 159.0566875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.58,
      "text": "The horse raced past the barn fell."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.44,
      "end": 5.5,
      "text": "On a first read, it feels like a mistake."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.18,
      "end": 8.94,
      "text": "You reach fell, and the sentence seems to stop short."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.66,
      "end": 12.08,
      "text": "The horse raced past the barn fell."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.12,
      "end": 14.14,
      "text": "So you read it again."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.74,
      "end": 16.22,
      "text": "Wait, did a barn fall?"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.72,
      "end": 18.92,
      "text": "Or did the horse race past the barn afterward?"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.72,
      "end": 22.96,
      "text": "You have to test out each possibility against the words in front of you."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.82,
      "end": 26.12,
      "text": "Finally, you parse the events in the right order."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.8,
      "end": 28.52,
      "text": "Someone raced a horse past a barn."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.52,
      "end": 30.18,
      "text": "Then, that horse fell."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.28,
      "end": 33.5,
      "text": "Working the sentence out depends on making multiple passes."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.1,
      "end": 36.42,
      "text": "Each read updates the meaning until it clicks."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.64,
      "end": 38.68,
      "text": "AI does something similar."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.28,
      "end": 41.1,
      "text": "It builds meaning through repeated updates."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.78,
      "end": 44.6,
      "text": "But beneath the surface, these models aren't scanning letters and verbs."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.04,
      "end": 49.16,
      "text": "They operate entirely on streams of numbers flowing from one stage to the next."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.74,
      "end": 51.36,
      "text": "AI doesn't read your message the way you do."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.14,
      "end": 53.78,
      "text": "This board shows the mechanical process."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.76,
      "end": 56.68,
      "text": "Numbers go in on one side and come out the other."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.06,
      "end": 59.28,
      "text": "The whole stack of layers is called a neural network."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.02,
      "end": 62.68,
      "text": "Inside every layer, you'll find the same two steps working together."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.4,
      "end": 64.3,
      "text": "Attention and transformation."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.04,
      "end": 65.68,
      "text": "Look at the bottom row."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.18,
      "end": 69.16,
      "text": "They start at 0.42 and negative 1.15."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.72,
      "end": 71.86,
      "text": "As they pass through the network, the values shift."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.44,
      "end": 76.66,
      "text": "By the end, those numbers have become 0.19 and negative 1.12."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.44,
      "end": 80.12,
      "text": "Attention and transformation update the numbers at each layer."
    },
    {
      "start": 80.86,
      "end": 83.24,
      "text": "Let's see what that math looks like when applied to a specific pronoun."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.84,
      "end": 85.58,
      "text": "Take the sentence at the top of this diagram."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.96,
      "end": 89.06,
      "text": "The tired cat sat on the mat during the May rainstorm."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.56,
      "end": 90.46,
      "text": "It soon fell asleep."
    },
    {
      "start": 91.38,
      "end": 93.32,
      "text": "In the starting column, it is ambiguous."
    },
    {
      "start": 93.9,
      "end": 98.94,
      "text": "Its starting numbers, 0.12 and negative 0.34, don't tell us what the pronoun refers to."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.58,
      "end": 103.54,
      "text": "Moving into layers one and two, those numbers shift to capture more information"
    },
    {
      "start": 103.54,
      "end": 105.82,
      "text": "about the connection between it and cat."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.4,
      "end": 108.42,
      "text": "Each layer builds on the previous layer's math"
    },
    {
      "start": 108.42,
      "end": 112.3,
      "text": "until we reach our final result of 0.41 and 0.06."
    },
    {
      "start": 112.83,
      "end": 116.74,
      "text": "Its updated numbers carry information about its connection to cat."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.42,
      "end": 121.28,
      "text": "That coarse sentence from earlier only took a few passes to untangle."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.94,
      "end": 125.72,
      "text": "But human language is full of sarcasm, story twists,"
    },
    {
      "start": 126.12,
      "end": 129.72,
      "text": "and complicated reasoning, which take far more effort to resolve."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.64,
      "end": 135.5,
      "text": "To handle that complexity, modern AI models stack up dozens of layers"
    },
    {
      "start": 135.5,
      "end": 137.54,
      "text": "and sometimes well over 100."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.32,
      "end": 141.84,
      "text": "The reason they stop adding layers comes down to hardware constraints."
    },
    {
      "start": 142.52,
      "end": 146.4,
      "text": "Every additional layer demands more computing power and processing time."
    },
    {
      "start": 146.94,
      "end": 149.04,
      "text": "The extra benefit has to be worth the cost."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.82,
      "end": 152.2,
      "text": "Meaning builds up, layer by layer."
    },
    {
      "start": 152.92,
      "end": 155.4,
      "text": "Attention and transformation, dozens of times."
    }
  ],
